
### 1. health check
GET http://localhost:8080/health

### 2. 강의 생성
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Java 입문",
  "description": "Java 기초부터 배우는 강의",
  "price": 50000,
  "maxCapacity": 30,
  "startDate": "2026-06-01",
  "endDate": "2026-06-30"
}

### 3. 강의 목록 전체 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes

### 4. 강의 목록 상태 필터 조회 (DRAFT/OPEN/CLOSED)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes?status=OPEN

### 5. 강의 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes/1

### 6. 강의 상태 변경 (정상 동작: DRAFT → OPEN)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes/1/status
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "OPEN"
}

### 7. 강의 상태 변경 (정상 동작: OPEN → CLOSED)
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes/1/status
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CLOSED"
}

### 8. 수강 신청
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/classes/1/enrollments
X-User-Id: 200

### 9. 결제 확정
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollments/1/confirm
X-User-Id: 200

### 10. 수강 취소
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollments/1/cancel
X-User-Id: 200

### 11. 내 수강 목록 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollments/me
X-User-Id: 200

### 12. 내 수강 목록 조회 (페이지네이션)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollments/me?page=0&size=5
X-User-Id: 200
